WEBVTT

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.760
Girls, let's go.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.560
Time to deliver the cookies!

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.040
Okay. But first,
we're going to dance class.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.880
Actually, we're going to have
to skip the dance class today.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.360
Actually, we can't
skip the dance class today.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.360
We have a big recital coming up.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.560
- We're doing an excerpt from
Swan Lake. - Yeah, Swan Lake!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.320
That's fantastic. Wonderful.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.320
But we're going to deliver cookies!
Come on!

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.400
No.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.240
No?

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.400
We're not going to deliver cookies
until we do dance class.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.560
Really?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.200
Well, I am not driving you
to dance class.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:00.440
So if you want to go, you are going
to have to walk yourselves.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.520
What are you doing?

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.280
Walking to dance class.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.240
Ya? Okay, fine.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:15.040
You just keep walking,
because I'm really not driving you!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.280
Okay.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.080
You're going to suffer
the wrath of Gru!

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.480
Seriously,
I'm going to count to three!

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.440
And you had better be in this car!

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:28.000
Here we go! One! Two!

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:31.520
...three, four and five.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:34.400
And lift, and stretch.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:36.960
And one, and two...

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.080
- Here you go.
- What is it?

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.560
Your ticket to the dance recital.
You are coming, right?

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.240
Of course, of course.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.280
I have pins and needles
that I'm sitting on.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.160
Pinkie promise?

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.400
Oh, yes. My pinkie promises.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:10.560
All right. Our first customer
is a man named Vector.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.320
But he's a V.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.280
You know, we're supposed
to start with the A's.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.200
Then we go to the B's. Then we...

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:21.000
Yes, yes! I went to kindergarten.
I know how the alphabet works!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.080
I was just thinking

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.760
that it might be nice
to deliver Mr Vector's first.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.400
That is all.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.960
Almost over. It's almost over.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:43.040
Girls, welcome back
to the fortress of Vector-tude!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.400
Do you have my cookies for me?

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.680
Four boxes of mini-mints, two
toffee totes,

00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:00.280
two caramel clumpies
and fifteen boxes of coco-nutties.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.800
Exactly. I'd like to see somebody
else order that many cookies.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:04.880
Not likely.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.080
Name one person
who ordered more cookies than me.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.640
That'll be 52 dollars.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.440
Right.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.320
Seven, eight, nine...

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.640
Tic Tacs! Where was I?

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.800
Seven, eight, nine...

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.600
Why are you wearing pyjamas?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.800
These aren't pyjamas!
This is a warm-up suit.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.040
- What are you warming up for?
- Stuff.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.120
What sort of stuff?

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.520
Super-cool stuff
you wouldn't understand.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.960
Like sleeping?

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.800
They are not pyjamas!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:13.240
Here you go, 52 big ones.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.000
Bye!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.040
Come on!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.960
What the...

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.280
Quiet down, fish!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.080
Down, boy!

